[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9840.87, "timestamp": "02:44:00", "text": "第一名是嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9842.309, "timestamp": "02:44:02", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9852.19, "timestamp": "02:44:12", "text": "呃，它朝向這個方向。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9854.389, "timestamp": "02:44:14", "text": "是的。他們都面向前方，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9855.71, "timestamp": "02:44:15", "text": "所以這就是原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9857.269, "timestamp": "02:44:17", "text": "是的，是的，是的，是的。方向"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9859.55, "timestamp": "02:44:19", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9861.95, "timestamp": "02:44:21", "text": "如果你私下做的話"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9863.749, "timestamp": "02:44:23", "text": "訊息已經傳達到第三個地點了，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9864.71, "timestamp": "02:44:24", "text": "[笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9864.99, "timestamp": "02:44:24", "text": "3"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9865.79, "timestamp": "02:44:25", "text": "第一個地點是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9874.95, "timestamp": "02:44:34", "text": "是啊，我也是這麼想的，我們都在想該如何面對這種空白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9877.11, "timestamp": "02:44:37", "text": "是的，因為我一直在問：“我該怎麼辦？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9888.389, "timestamp": "02:44:48", "text": "嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9889.23, "timestamp": "02:44:49", "text": "哦，這很簡單。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9890.55, "timestamp": "02:44:50", "text": "是的，就是這裡。一個，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9893.269, "timestamp": "02:44:53", "text": "我想我們可以走了，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9897.55, "timestamp": "02:44:57", "text": "我能做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9898.19, "timestamp": "02:44:58", "text": "一定。"}]